Using the following code, I generated the attached spectrogram plus oscillogram. The oscillogram is slightly compressed in time relative to the spectrogram, so they are not aligned. How can this be fixed?

Thanks,
Ted

spectro(aa, ovlp=90,  wn = "hamming", osc = TRUE, wl=256, flim=c(1, 4), tlim=c(1.61, 2.04), grid = FALSE, collevels=seq(-20,0,1))

